Description:You control Doubling Season and Sorin, Vengeful Bloodlord (4 loyalty), and your Guildpact Informant is attacking the opponent, who controls no creatures and is at 20 life. End the turn with exactly 8 loyalty counters on Sorin, Vengeful Bloodlord and the opponent at 18 life.
Rule:rulesguru-a751678cf7a59ea6 | Doubling Season doubles counters put by effects, not counters put as a loyalty cost (CR 606.4, 609.1): Sorin's +2 adds 2, and a proliferate (an effect, CR 701.34a) adds 2 more
